    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Boutiq Pop-Up Event",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "April 18, 2026\n@ 4:00 pm\n- 7:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9b7f4c46-Boutiq-Logo.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Boutiq-Logo.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Shop the Boutiq brand at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 340,
     "h": 76,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join us on Saturday April 18, 2026 from 4pm – 7pm and learn about the Boutiq brand and their products."
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "We currently carry their SWITCH™ Liquid Diamond – 2 Flavor / Strain – 2g Dual Disposables that are a fan favorite."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Featuring cutting-edge dual chamber technology, SWITCH™ offers two distinct strains in a single sleek device that can be hit individually, or both at once. BOUTIQ™ Oil is a blend of pure Liquid Live Diamonds and expertly curated Terpenes.</p><p><img alt=\"Grape Soda (IDH) + Crunch Berry (IDH) | Dual Disposable image 0\" width=\"231\" height=\"231\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/2ab3c53b1660a0dcb67b8b4e9b89ecc6\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\">The SWITCH™ interface allows users to seamlessly alternate between strains or blend them together, offering a personalized experience unlike anything before it. Its integrated display clearly indicates strain selection, battery life, and Blinker Count™—delivering a vaping ritual that’s interactive, refined, and uniquely personal.</p><p>The BOUTIQ SWITCH™ delivers cannabis exactly as it should be: iconic, intentional, and unmatched.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/boutiq/\"><strong>Click here to shop Boutiq SWITCH™ Dual Disposables!</strong></a></p>"
    },
